                  "value": "This scoping review aims to assess the influence of non-pharmacological interventions on work participation outcomes in people with multiple sclerosis (MS). The specific research questions are:\n(1)\tFor which non-pharmacological interventions has the influence on work participation outcomes been assessed? \n(2)\tWhat is the effectiveness of these non-pharmacological interventions on work participation outcomes?"
